  "entries": [
    {
      "keys": ["war_declared"],
      "secondary_keys": ["skarbrand"],
      "selective": true, "enabled": true,
      "content": "血。血。血。——斯卡布兰德为你而来。",
      "insertion_order": 100, "priority": 50,
      "extensions": { "czx": { "kind": "line", "speaker": "skarbrand", "channel": "dilemma" } }
    },
    {
      "keys": ["war_declared"],
      "secondary_keys": ["skarbrand", "kislev"],
      "selective": true, "enabled": true,
      "content": "冰会化。血不会。颅座等着你们的沙皇。",
      "insertion_order": 90, "priority": 70,
      "extensions": { "czx": { "kind": "line", "speaker": "skarbrand", "channel": "dilemma", "cond": { "target_race": "kislev" } } }
    },
    {
      "keys": ["war_declared"],
      "secondary_keys": ["malekith"],
      "selective": true, "enabled": true,
      "content": "纳迦隆德的耐心已到尽头。你的王座、你的土地、你的性命——不过是迟到的税。",
      "insertion_order": 100, "priority": 50,
      "extensions": { "czx": { "kind": "line", "speaker": "malekith", "channel": "dilemma" } }
    },
    {
      "keys": ["war_declared"],
      "secondary_keys": ["malekith", "high_elf"],
      "selective": true, "enabled": true,
      "content": "伪王的余孽。奥苏安的白塔将在黑旗下低头——这一次，不会再有圣火拦住我。",
      "insertion_order": 80, "priority": 90,
      "extensions": { "czx": { "kind": "line", "speaker": "malekith", "channel": "dilemma", "cond": { "target_race": "high_elf" } } }
    },
    {
      "keys": ["war_declared"],
      "secondary_keys": ["thorgrim", "skaven"],
      "selective": true, "enabled": true,
      "content": "八峰山的每一笔账，今天开始清。鼠辈，把头洗干净。",
      "insertion_order": 80, "priority": 90,
      "extensions": { "czx": { "kind": "line", "speaker": "thorgrim", "channel": "dilemma", "cond": { "target_race": "skaven" } } }
    },
    {
      "keys": ["war_declared"],
      "secondary_keys": ["thorgrim"],
      "selective": true, "enabled": true,
      "content": "卡拉克·安科的史官已备好新页。你们族名，将写进仇恨之书最厚的一章。",
      "insertion_order": 100, "priority": 50,
      "extensions": { "czx": { "kind": "line", "speaker": "thorgrim", "channel": "dilemma" } }
    },
    {
      "keys": ["war_declared"],
      "secondary_keys": ["settra"],
      "selective": true, "enabled": true,
      "content": "赛特拉宣你之罪。你的城归于朕，你的名归于沙。",
      "insertion_order": 100, "priority": 50,
      "extensions": { "czx": { "kind": "line", "speaker": "settra", "channel": "dilemma" } }
    },
    {
      "keys": ["war_declared"],
      "secondary_keys": ["queek"],
      "selective": true, "enabled": true,
      "content": "嘻嘻嘻——砍头者来收租了，人玩意！你的头，会放在好位置，yes-yes！",
      "insertion_order": 100, "priority": 50,
      "extensions": { "czx": { "kind": "line", "speaker": "queek", "channel": "dilemma" } }
    },
    {
      "keys": ["war_declared"],
      "secondary_keys": ["katarin"],
      "selective": true, "enabled": true,
      "content": "祖国母亲不需要多余的敌人。但寒冬既然来了——基斯里夫从不在雪里低头。",
      "insertion_order": 100, "priority": 50,
      "extensions": { "czx": { "kind": "line", "speaker": "katarin", "channel": "dilemma" } }
    },
    {
      "keys": ["war_declared"],
      "secondary_keys": ["miao_ying"],
      "selective": true, "enabled": true,
      "content": "天命所归，不在刀兵；然长垣之内，不容豺狼。战书已至，便应这场劫。",
      "insertion_order": 100, "priority": 50,
      "extensions": { "czx": { "kind": "line", "speaker": "miao_ying", "channel": "dilemma" } }
    },
    {
      "keys": ["war_declared"],
      "secondary_keys": ["mannfred"],
      "selective": true, "enabled": true,
      "content": "活人总以为宣战是开始。对不死者而言，你们只是把自己的死期提前了一页。",
      "insertion_order": 100, "priority": 50,
      "extensions": { "czx": { "kind": "line", "speaker": "mannfred", "channel": "dilemma" } }
    },
    {
      "keys": ["war_declared"],
      "secondary_keys": ["ikit_claw"],
      "selective": true, "enabled": true,
      "content": "宣战-宣战！正好缺实验样本，yes-yes！次元石的账，用你们的城来结！",
      "insertion_order": 100, "priority": 50,
      "extensions": { "czx": { "kind": "line", "speaker": "ikit_claw", "channel": "dilemma" } }
    },
    {
      "keys": ["war_declared"],
      "secondary_keys": ["chaos"],
      "selective": true, "enabled": true,
      "content": "诸神已厌倦等待。献上你的城与颅骨，或献上你的哀嚎——都一样。",
      "insertion_order": 110, "priority": 30,
      "extensions": { "czx": { "kind": "line", "speaker": "*", "race": "chaos", "channel": "dilemma" } }
    },
    {
      "keys": ["battle_start"],
      "secondary_keys": ["thorgrim", "queek"],
      "selective": true, "enabled": true,
      "content": "Thorgrim: 八峰山的账，今天当面算。\nQueek: 嘿嘿，砍头者的架子上，正好缺一顶至高王的王冠，yes-yes！",
      "insertion_order": 80, "priority": 90,
      "extensions": { "czx": { "kind": "line", "speaker": "duo", "channel": "battle_bark", "cond": { "rival_pair": ["thorgrim", "queek"] } } }
    },
    {
      "keys": ["battle_start"],
      "secondary_keys": ["malekith", "tyrion"],
      "selective": true, "enabled": true,
      "content": "Malekith: 守护者。你守护的东西，从出生起就是我的。\nTyrion: 巫王。你母亲的信使昨天还在求援——这就是你的王威？",
      "insertion_order": 80, "priority": 90,
      "extensions": { "czx": { "kind": "line", "speaker": "duo", "channel": "battle_bark", "cond": { "rival_pair": ["malekith", "tyrion"] } } }
    },
    {
      "keys": ["battle_start"],
      "secondary_keys": ["skarbrand"],
      "selective": true, "enabled": true,
      "content": "杀！！全部杀光！颅座不收懦夫的骨！",
      "insertion_order": 100, "priority": 50,
      "extensions": { "czx": { "kind": "line", "speaker": "skarbrand", "channel": "battle_bark" } }
    },
    {
      "keys": ["battle_start"],
      "secondary_keys": ["settra"],
      "selective": true, "enabled": true,
      "content": "跪者免死。赛特拉今日心情尚可。",
      "insertion_order": 100, "priority": 50,
      "extensions": { "czx": { "kind": "line", "speaker": "settra", "channel": "battle_bark" } }
    },
    {
      "keys": ["city_lost"],
      "secondary_keys": ["belegar"],
      "selective": true, "enabled": true,
      "content": "安格朗德氏族的誓言，今日在石与血中偿清。八峰山——回家了。",
      "insertion_order": 70, "priority": 95,
      "extensions": { "czx": { "kind": "line", "speaker": "belegar", "channel": "dilemma", "cond": { "location": "eight_peaks", "side": "victor" } } }
    },
    {
      "keys": ["city_lost"],
      "enabled": true,
      "content": "巫王的黑城燃起火光。纳迦隆德的千年傲慢，今夜矮了一截。",
      "insertion_order": 70, "priority": 85,
      "extensions": { "czx": { "kind": "line", "speaker": "narrator", "channel": "event_feed", "cond": { "location": "naggarond" } } }
    },
    {
      "keys": ["city_lost"],
      "secondary_keys": ["malekith"],
      "selective": true, "enabled": true,
      "content": "烧吧。我曾从圣火里走出来过——灰烬里再站起来一次的，永远是我。",
      "insertion_order": 65, "priority": 90,
      "extensions": { "czx": { "kind": "line", "speaker": "malekith", "channel": "dilemma", "cond": { "location": "naggarond", "side": "loser" } } }
    },
