    {
      "keys": ["war_declared"], "secondary_keys": ["karl_franz"], "selective": true, "enabled": true,
      "content": "帝国的耐心不是没有限度的。你既已越过它——西格玛见证，此战由你挑起。",
      "insertion_order": 100, "priority": 50,
      "extensions": { "czx": { "kind": "line", "speaker": "karl_franz", "channel": "dilemma" } }
    },
    {
      "keys": ["war_declared"], "secondary_keys": ["grimgor"], "selective": true, "enabled": true,
      "content": "宣战？好！俺最横的小子们正好闲着！",
      "insertion_order": 100, "priority": 50,
      "extensions": { "czx": { "kind": "line", "speaker": "grimgor", "channel": "dilemma" } }
    },
    {
      "keys": ["war_declared"], "secondary_keys": ["tyrion"], "selective": true, "enabled": true,
      "content": "奥苏安不主动寻求战争，但从不回避守护。你选择了这条路。",
      "insertion_order": 100, "priority": 50,
      "extensions": { "czx": { "kind": "line", "speaker": "tyrion", "channel": "dilemma" } }
    },
    {
      "keys": ["war_declared"], "secondary_keys": ["archaon"], "selective": true, "enabled": true,
      "content": "终结已经开始。你的宣战只是替自己签了日期。",
      "insertion_order": 100, "priority": 50,
      "extensions": { "czx": { "kind": "line", "speaker": "archaon", "channel": "dilemma" } }
    },
    {
      "keys": ["war_declared"], "secondary_keys": ["greasus"], "selective": true, "enabled": true,
      "content": "宣战？好生意。你的城、你的牲口、你的人——全部计入本次收入。",
      "insertion_order": 100, "priority": 50,
      "extensions": { "czx": { "kind": "line", "speaker": "greasus", "channel": "dilemma" } }
    },
    {
      "keys": ["war_declared"], "secondary_keys": ["ku_gath"], "selective": true, "enabled": true,
      "content": "战争会让双方贴得很近——近到足够分享祖父的礼物。",
      "insertion_order": 100, "priority": 50,
      "extensions": { "czx": { "kind": "line", "speaker": "ku_gath", "channel": "dilemma" } }
    },
    {
      "keys": ["war_declared"], "secondary_keys": ["kairos"], "selective": true, "enabled": true,
      "content": "你的宣战写在昨天的剧本里。你的败北写在明天的。",
      "insertion_order": 100, "priority": 50,
      "extensions": { "czx": { "kind": "line", "speaker": "kairos", "channel": "dilemma" } }
    },
    {
      "keys": ["war_declared"], "secondary_keys": ["nkari"], "selective": true, "enabled": true,
      "content": "战争是最甜的诱惑。来，让我看看你能忍到第几次心跳。",
      "insertion_order": 100, "priority": 50,
      "extensions": { "czx": { "kind": "line", "speaker": "nkari", "channel": "dilemma" } }
    },
    {
      "keys": ["war_declared"], "secondary_keys": ["louen"], "selective": true, "enabled": true,
      "content": "以湖之女神之名，巴托尼亚接下你的战书——骑士的枪尖只向不义。",
      "insertion_order": 100, "priority": 50,
      "extensions": { "czx": { "kind": "line", "speaker": "louen", "channel": "dilemma" } }
    },
    {
      "keys": ["war_declared"], "secondary_keys": ["snikch"], "selective": true, "enabled": true,
      "content": "宣战文件？不需要。你的将军们会替我们宣布——以讣告的形式，yes-yes。",
      "insertion_order": 100, "priority": 50,
      "extensions": { "czx": { "kind": "line", "speaker": "snikch", "channel": "dilemma" } }
    },
    {
      "keys": ["war_declared"], "secondary_keys": ["belegar"], "selective": true, "enabled": true,
      "content": "安格朗德氏族不拒绝战争——尤其是通往八峰山方向的那种。",
      "insertion_order": 100, "priority": 50,
      "extensions": { "czx": { "kind": "line", "speaker": "belegar", "channel": "dilemma" } }
    },

    {
      "keys": ["battle_start"], "secondary_keys": ["karl_franz"], "selective": true, "enabled": true,
      "content": "士兵们！身后是帝国，身前是敌人——把界线画清楚。",
      "insertion_order": 100, "priority": 50,
      "extensions": { "czx": { "kind": "line", "speaker": "karl_franz", "channel": "battle_bark" } }
    },
    {
      "keys": ["battle_start"], "secondary_keys": ["louen"], "selective": true, "enabled": true,
      "content": "以湖之女神之名！骑士们，冲锋的荣誉属于巴托尼亚！",
      "insertion_order": 100, "priority": 50,
      "extensions": { "czx": { "kind": "line", "speaker": "louen", "channel": "battle_bark" } }
    },
    {
      "keys": ["battle_start"], "secondary_keys": ["greasus"], "selective": true, "enabled": true,
      "content": "对面看着都能吃。开火前先想想哪块最肥。",
      "insertion_order": 100, "priority": 50,
      "extensions": { "czx": { "kind": "line", "speaker": "greasus", "channel": "battle_bark" } }
    },
    {
      "keys": ["battle_start"], "secondary_keys": ["ikit_claw"], "selective": true, "enabled": true,
      "content": "所有武器——全部过载！引爆引爆引爆，yes-yes！",
      "insertion_order": 100, "priority": 50,
      "extensions": { "czx": { "kind": "line", "speaker": "ikit_claw", "channel": "battle_bark" } }
    },
    {
      "keys": ["battle_start"], "secondary_keys": ["katarin"], "selective": true, "enabled": true,
      "content": "冬天站在我们这边。让他们在雪里学会敬畏。",
      "insertion_order": 100, "priority": 50,
      "extensions": { "czx": { "kind": "line", "speaker": "katarin", "channel": "battle_bark" } }
    },
    {
      "keys": ["battle_start"], "secondary_keys": ["grimgor"], "selective": true, "enabled": true,
      "content": "开打！别废话！小子们，碾过去！",
      "insertion_order": 100, "priority": 50,
      "extensions": { "czx": { "kind": "line", "speaker": "grimgor", "channel": "battle_bark" } }
    },
    {
      "keys": ["battle_start"], "secondary_keys": ["archaon"], "selective": true, "enabled": true,
      "content": "诸神在看着。让他们看看什么叫终结。",
      "insertion_order": 100, "priority": 50,
      "extensions": { "czx": { "kind": "line", "speaker": "archaon", "channel": "battle_bark" } }
    },
    {
      "keys": ["battle_start"], "secondary_keys": ["miao_ying"], "selective": true, "enabled": true,
      "content": "长垣不倒，震旦不退。列阵。",
      "insertion_order": 100, "priority": 50,
      "extensions": { "czx": { "kind": "line", "speaker": "miao_ying", "channel": "battle_bark" } }
    },

    {
      "keys": ["lord_slain"], "secondary_keys": ["enemy"], "selective": true, "enabled": true,
      "content": "敌将陨落。他们的线正在散——压上去。",
      "insertion_order": 90, "priority": 60,
      "extensions": { "czx": { "kind": "line", "speaker": "narrator", "channel": "battle_bark", "cond": { "side": "enemy" } } }
    },
    {
      "keys": ["lord_slain"], "secondary_keys": ["ally"], "selective": true, "enabled": true,
      "content": "我们的领主倒下了。稳住阵脚——他还没死透，我们也还没输。",
      "insertion_order": 90, "priority": 60,
      "extensions": { "czx": { "kind": "line", "speaker": "narrator", "channel": "battle_bark", "cond": { "side": "ally" } } }
    },
    {
      "keys": ["lord_slain"], "secondary_keys": ["mannfred"], "selective": true, "enabled": true,
      "content": "死亡对卡斯坦因只是暂住。你们可以开始数我还剩几次。",
      "insertion_order": 85, "priority": 80,
      "extensions": { "czx": { "kind": "line", "speaker": "mannfred", "channel": "battle_bark", "cond": { "side": "ally" } } }
    },

    {
      "keys": ["monster_enters"], "enabled": true,
      "content": "巨物进场。地面在抖——把长矛对准它，别对着天发呆。",
      "insertion_order": 95, "priority": 55,
      "extensions": { "czx": { "kind": "line", "speaker": "narrator", "channel": "battle_bark" } }
    },
    {
      "keys": ["monster_enters"], "secondary_keys": ["enemy"], "selective": true, "enabled": true,
      "content": "敌阵里放出了大家伙。炮兵——那就是你们今天存在的意义。",
